## 6. The Claude Code layer

Everything the toolkit installs **points into your toolkit checkout**: its
`toolkit-*` plugins, which carry the hooks, load from the `claude-code-toolkit`
marketplace entry (`claude plugin marketplace list` shows the path), and the
`~/.local/bin` CLIs are symlinks into it. Edit the checkout, never hunt for a
second copy. After an update, re-run `./install.sh` from the primary checkout,
then start a new session (or run `/reload-plugins`) so plugin changes load.
`./install.sh --check` changes nothing and lists anything that has drifted.
Your personal values live **outside** the checkout at
`~/.config/claude-code-toolkit/config.json`.

Run `/hooks` to see what's active in the current session.

